Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.97,0:00:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Y ему, y ему,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,y ему, y ему,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,y ему, y ему!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! The Beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.49,0:01:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That breeze feels nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.97,0:01:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess this virtual world\Ndoes have some good points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.11,0:01:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Five old creepy guys\Nwant to steal our bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you talk about good points?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.49,0:01:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke, chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.75,0:01:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.33,0:01:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm trying to help certain\Npeople stay calm, Einstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.85,0:01:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you don't have to worry about me being\Nscared, because you make me feel safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.99,0:01:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, of course, you're\Nalways in good hands with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, she means both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.75,0:01:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, man, she means me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.29,0:01:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to do something\Nabout that breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.07,0:01:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.59,0:01:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, come on, don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.27,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.19,0:01:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to work together\Nto find a way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.57,0:01:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And time's running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.35,0:01:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, those guys could show up any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before we're\Nset free from this virtual prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.87,0:02:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, when one of us defeats you in\Na duel, we'll claim control of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.57,0:02:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.53,0:02:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't forget, there are five of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.87,0:02:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So they're not only after\NKaiba, Yugi, and Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.85,0:02:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They may also want to duel against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.39,0:02:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.89,0:02:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's no way we'll lose a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if we stick with Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.95,0:02:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.31,0:02:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that Tristan taught my\Nbrother Joey everything about dueling?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.43,0:02:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What else did you tell this\Npoor girl about your soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.29,0:02:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.51,0:02:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been a champion duelist\Never since I could hold up a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.85,0:02:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeating the Big Five will\Nbe like a walk in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.41,0:02:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, guys, the good news is that each of\Nus defeated one member of the Freaky Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.59,0:02:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Three down, two to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.07,0:02:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The bad news is we don't know\Nwhere they're going to strike next.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Or who they're going to strike next.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.77,0:02:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.53,0:02:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey! Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.05,0:02:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me we're not\Ngoing through that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.91,0:02:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.39,0:03:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what if it leads back\Nhome to the real world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.05,0:03:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And what if it doesn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.47,0:03:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.11,0:03:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but Duke may be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.21,0:03:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we'll never\Nknow unless we try, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.81,0:03:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Serenity, wait! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.79,0:03:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's too bright to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.33,0:03:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.67,0:03:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're back where we started\Nbefore the Big Five sent us to Virtual Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.07,0:03:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no sign of\Nthe blimp in here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.89,0:03:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be another\Npart of Noah's Fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.95,0:03:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So are we in the real world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.49,0:03:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so. Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.01,0:03:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of giant\Nrobot or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.23,0:03:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.65,0:03:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.53,0:03:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,In the outside world,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.93,0:03:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I was known as Nesbitt, former vice\Npresident of new technology at Kaivakor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.67,0:03:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But here in the virtual realm,\NI am known as Robotic Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:04:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,a creature that represents\Nthe power of machine over man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.89,0:04:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,As the tech expert of the Big Five,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.25,0:04:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I designed some of Kyberkov's\Nmost advanced machinery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And as soon as I out-duel one of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.31,0:04:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to continue\Nmy work in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.83,0:04:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, ladies first. Me? But I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never dueled before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.67,0:04:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nesbit, leave Serenity out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.53,0:04:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to duel someone,\Nduel me, you scrap heap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.75,0:04:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, fight me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.29,0:04:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know what you're\Ngetting yourself into, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.67,0:04:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not the time\Nto be showing off, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.47,0:04:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you're some kind of dueling\Nexpert, I've dueled more times than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.09,0:04:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have challenged the female to a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall begin our battle immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.17,0:04:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I said you're dueling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let either of\Nthese two duel alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.19,0:04:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the most experienced duelist here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm the only one with a chance\Nof beating this walking tin can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.99,0:04:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, if he wins, he gets to escape\Nto the real world in one of our bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:05:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,As much as I'd like to see Tristan\Nsquirm, the stakes are too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.17,0:05:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I've got a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.11,0:05:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Me and Tristan here will both take you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.23,0:05:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat us and you'll get two\Nbodies for the price of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Negative, but you have given me an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel shall be three against one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.89,0:05:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding? No,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,for when I defeat you, we'll gain\Ncontrol of all of your bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving your three minds\Ntrapped here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.87,0:05:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,When this duel is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.83,0:05:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have proven once and for all that\Nmachines are more powerful than people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.33,0:05:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,In his dreams. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.25,0:05:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I intend to pull the plug on all three\Nof you, so let us begin this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.11,0:05:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, man, it's gonna be two on one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.15,0:05:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Tristan. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.45,0:05:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be three on one,\Nbecause we're all in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.99,0:05:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But Serenity...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.17,0:05:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:05:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll follow your lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.81,0:06:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm scared of.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.31,0:06:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you don't have to do\Nthis, Serenity. Correction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.93,0:06:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say she does. Observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.19,0:06:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone wearing a dual\Ndisc must participate. Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.85,0:06:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, just think this\Nover for a bit, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.79,0:06:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.05,0:06:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just do exactly what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.81,0:06:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.17,0:06:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of been a\Nwhile since I've dueled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.09,0:06:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to build your\Ndecks for the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.25,0:06:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply touch the cards you desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.45,0:06:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I choose, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.31,0:06:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all, trust your\Ninstincts, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.77,0:06:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And make sure you pick\Na nice variety of cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.67,0:06:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need magic, trap, and\Nmonster cards for your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.73,0:06:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.85,0:06:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.89,0:06:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,oh, that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.33,0:06:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, well, here goes. Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to choose a monster\Nto act as your Deckmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.27,0:06:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, my Deckmaster is\Ngoing to be Strike Ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I pick, uh, Goddess with the Third Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose Super Robo Yarrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.29,0:07:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll be acting as my own\NDeckmaster, Robotic Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.51,0:07:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And just to make this\Nduel more interesting,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll be battling above a\Nsea of radioactive waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.19,0:07:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Play by the rules and you won't fall in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.85,0:07:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one regulation in particular\NI'll be strictly enforcing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.15,0:07:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Under no circumstances are any of you to\Ndiscuss your strategy with one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.21,0:07:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Break this rule and you'll plummet\Ninto the toxic abyss below.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.51,0:07:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.95,0:07:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I duel without your advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.11,0:07:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.75,0:07:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The female shall begin\Nthis battle. Engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.77,0:07:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.37,0:07:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.55,0:08:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see, which card should I play?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.35,0:08:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm going to summon\NShadow Tamer in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.41,0:08:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait, in attack\Nmode? Oh, I didn't mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.83,0:08:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,up already did I that monster is too weak
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.87,0:08:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,to play an attack mode I'm terrible sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.75,0:08:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, you did just fine.\NReally, you're a natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.99,0:08:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah a natural disaster i'll end my turn
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.45,0:08:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,now all right nesbit my move i've got to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,lead this metal meathead\Naway from serenity's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.39,0:08:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,monster so now i'll play cyber commander
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.49,0:08:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,come and get me punk tristan\Nplayed a weaker monster
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.25,0:08:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Than Serenity, so Nesbit will\Nattack him instead, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.19,0:09:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,it's up to me now let's see\Ncome on duke use your head
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.41,0:09:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,for once just play a lame\Nmonster so robo geek will attack
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.69,0:09:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,you instead of blasting\Npoor serenity i summon the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.27,0:09:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,13th grave now in defense
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.79,0:09:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,mode way to look out for your
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.59,0:09:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,teammates duke i'll stop here\Nit's time for me to accelerate
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.63,0:09:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,into high gear with this\Ngigatech wolf attack the female
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.37,0:09:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow Tamer. Oh no, he went\Nafter Serenity's monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.95,0:09:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,serenity
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,it appears the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.99,0:09:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,machines are ahead are you okay
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And the humans are down, you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.23,0:09:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,hear that that was serenity
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.95,0:09:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,screaming just now i know it\Nwe're gonna find her joey i
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.55,0:09:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,hope so hello serenity
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.63,0:10:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,we're living in an age where
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.59,0:10:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,machines rule and now your\Nlittle girlfriend is paying the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.31,0:10:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,price i'm fine serenity are\Nyou sure yeah this is just bad
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.79,0:10:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,we're no match for this guy\Nand the stakes are too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.25,0:10:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Serenity, I can't let Metalhead\Nover here get the best of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.57,0:10:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to feel\Nmy iron fist again. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.13,0:10:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the three of you\Ncombined can take me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.17,0:10:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now observe my Deckmaster's\Nspecial ability, Final Artillery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Each machine monster I discard will\Ninflict 500 life points of damage to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.33,0:10:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.31,0:10:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough torment for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.37,0:10:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll place this card\Nface down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.79,0:10:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity's not looking too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.05,0:10:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm okay, guys, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.11,0:10:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I should put this\Nin defense mode, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.49,0:11:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now you're getting\Nthe hang of it. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.43,0:11:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon the Forgiving\NMaiden in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.09,0:11:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, she put it in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.19,0:11:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, you put your card on\Nthe dual disc the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.99,0:11:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want your monster in defense mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.03,0:11:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to place it\Nsideways on the dual disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.63,0:11:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.54,0:11:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence, humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.65,0:11:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No discussing moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let her take that turn over, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.75,0:11:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Negative, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.11,0:11:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No second chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.91,0:11:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.51,0:11:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I know she's trying her best, but\Nwe can't afford any more mess-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.29,0:11:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a plan to fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.45,0:11:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.23,0:11:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A block attack magic card. Sweet.\NNow I can switch the mode of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.07,0:11:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,serenity's monster now I activate\Nblock attack nice effort but it's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.31,0:12:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to reveal my face down card.\NRiroku, field it destroys any magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.77,0:12:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,card that's used on a monster
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.51,0:12:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah I can see that okay now what
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.23,0:12:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, this desert never ends!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.81,0:12:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, isn't that Nesbitt's\Nold research lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.17,0:12:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I always hated that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.19,0:12:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Nesbitt, now that I'm in charge,\Nthis company's heading in a new direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.59,0:12:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why I'm shutting\Ndown your lab. No, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.05,0:12:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Please reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.61,0:12:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What about all the military\Ntechnology I've created? No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.03,0:12:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you destroy my lab!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.87,0:12:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch what you say, Nesbitt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.81,0:12:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.71,0:12:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no choice but to\Ntear down that sweatshop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.35,0:12:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,His battle machines were\Nuseless in the new Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.39,0:13:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And sometimes starting over\Nmeans erasing the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.23,0:13:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't lead me around your\Nworld like a puppet forever, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.43,0:13:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,In my world, I can do whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.39,0:13:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, I'm having too much fun\Ntoying with your head to stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, if you think this is bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.01,0:13:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,just wait until you see what\NI have in store for you next.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.73,0:13:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If I want to do some\Ndamage, I gotta play smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.77,0:13:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.89,0:13:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave Serenity\Nout in the open again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.11,0:13:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.13,0:13:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Yoronzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yoronzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.81,0:13:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's never gonna\Nhelp us, dude. Then I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.23,0:13:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,finish things off by placing\None card face down very
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.49,0:13:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,well I shall sacrifice my\Ngigatech wolf in order to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.43,0:13:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,summon Machine King and\Nthanks to its special ability
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.07,0:13:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Machine King receives\Nanother 100 attack points
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.21,0:13:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,for every machine monster\Nin play that includes your
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.77,0:14:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,cyber commander Tristan so\Nthanks for the power boost
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.03,0:14:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,you fool and now Now it's\Ntime to put them to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.75,0:14:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Machine King, attack the\Nfemales for giving Maiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.09,0:14:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.03,0:14:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyber Commander, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.27,0:14:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool, Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a shaver!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.97,0:14:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.51,0:14:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have protected her without\Nlosing points, you show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.73,0:14:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, just back off, you're no help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we have to play\Nsmart or we'll all lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate Card of Sanctity, requiring\Nall of us to draw from our decks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.85,0:14:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop until you have\Nsix cards in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.49,0:14:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of it as recharging your\Nbatteries to refresh the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.55,0:14:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You done?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.53,0:14:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, can we go now? Not yet. Next,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.39,0:14:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll dispose of three Machine monsters to\Nactivate my Deck Master's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.63,0:14:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Final Artillery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.91,0:15:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to 500 more life points each.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.91,0:15:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon you'll all be obsolete.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.97,0:15:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll place this face\Ndown and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.45,0:15:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.29,0:15:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Lady Panther in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll switch the Forgiving\NMaiden from attack to defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.31,0:15:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You go, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.79,0:15:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.09,0:15:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon Command Angel\Nto the field in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.27,0:15:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on a roll now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.25,0:15:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon forth my Dark\NAssailant in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.13,0:15:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've lined up\Nyour monsters for me to knock
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,down one by one as I move closer\Nto disassembling you three.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.79,0:15:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you rust bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.83,0:15:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get past our\Narmy of defensive monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.63,0:15:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and I dare you to attack\Nus directly again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.47,0:16:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit flapping your lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.37,0:16:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need to give him any ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.63,0:16:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.67,0:16:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have enough cards left to\Nactivate his Deckmaster ability again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.39,0:16:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So our life points are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost correct, but you've\Nforgotten about my trap card. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.37,0:16:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Backup Soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.31,0:16:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.33,0:16:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I have more than five\Nmonsters in my graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.75,0:16:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,this trap card allows me to bring\Nthree of them back to my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it looks like I'll be able to\Nactivate my Deckmaster ability after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.39,0:16:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll take the three\Nmonsters I've just.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.09,0:16:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,received and deposit them\Nback to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.21,0:16:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus activating my special\Nability, Final Artillery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some originality and\Ndo something new for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.31,0:16:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why change a good thing? Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.33,0:16:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Reliability is the key to a good invention
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too strong. Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.35,0:17:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but you've only seen a small\Nsample of my overall strength
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.33,0:17:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What you're about to experience\Nwill blow your circuits
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.97,0:17:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet Clockwork Knight. This\Nmagic card has the power to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.37,0:17:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,transform all of your monsters\Ninto machines Say what? No way,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.83,0:17:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,man And in addition to\Nturning your creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.05,0:17:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Into metal, they'll each\Nlose 500 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.05,0:17:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.75,0:17:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,my Machine King gets an additional 100\Npoints for every machine monster in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.93,0:17:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and I count six.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.03,0:17:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, Clockwork Knight gives\Nmy Machine King 500 extra points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.77,0:17:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nesbitt can't be stopped now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Chill out, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.95,0:17:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.51,0:17:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Our monsters are in\Ndefense mode, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.81,0:17:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If we keep cool, that pile\Nof scrap can't hurt us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.73,0:17:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You must grow tired of\Nbeing wrong all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.53,0:17:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Engage, short circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, unlike humans,\Nmachines follow commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.79,0:18:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.59,0:18:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.87,0:18:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If you haven't already figured it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.37,0:18:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,this magic card gives\Nme the power to change
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.05,0:18:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,all of your monsters from\Ndefense to attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.17,0:18:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So once again, your life\Npoints are in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.69,0:18:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I hate this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.45,0:18:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He never lost control of this\Nmatch for a second. Now witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,the triumph of machine over\NMatt or should I say female?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.27,0:18:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Machine King prepare to attack\Nher forgiving maiden now
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity no
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.59,0:18:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll lose the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.25,0:18:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There's got to be something\NI can do to save her,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.85,0:18:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But what I got it? I can use my Deck\NMaster to intercept his attack. Go, No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.31,0:18:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Super Roboyaro! No! Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.41,0:18:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If your Deckmaster's destroyed, you lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.81,0:18:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster's special ability allows\Nme to play this card face down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.11,0:18:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then its attack points go up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.01,0:18:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Not by enough, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.17,0:19:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monster has sadly\Nbecome last year's model!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.57,0:19:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Deckmaster is\Ndestroyed, so is the duelist!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm aware of that, you\Noversized trash can!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, no more lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.99,0:19:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not the duelist you think I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.03,0:19:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't teach Joey how to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.11,0:19:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I hardly know the basics of duel monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.79,0:19:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, you better take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.77,0:19:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost the duel, so it's\Ntime for you to go down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.57,0:19:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.49,0:19:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come back! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.59,0:19:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He said we'd only fall\Nif we cheated. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.79,0:19:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,His mind has been\Ndigitized and his body is
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,in a holding area\Nwaiting to be taken over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.43,0:19:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll both join him soon enough.
